  "projectUrl": "https://github.com/Pascal-Krenckel/FFmpeg",
  "published": "2026-07-30T21:06:10.307Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "--- 8.1.2.6 --- \n\t\t\tFFmpegDotNet._AutoGen was not build against FFmpeg 8.1.2 but master - FFmpeg 9.0 (pre)\n\t\t\t--- 8.1.2.5 ---\n\t\t\tReworked filtering\n\t\t\tRemoved dupplicated function in filters, moved FilterContext Create[Filter] function in Audio/VideoFilters.\n\t\t\tDocumentation\n\t\t\tSome BugFixes in FilterGraph\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t--- 8.1.2.4 ---\n\t\t\tBugFix: FormatContext.WritePacket wrote interleaved packets previously.\n\t\t\tBugFix/full implementation: MediaSink is now fully implemented, some bugs got fixed\n\t\t\tBugFix: SwsContext copies now into \"readonly\" AVFrame\n\t\t\tBugFix: SwsContext does create a Buffer if the frame does not have one. The plane pointers are fetched after the buffer was created\n\t\t\t--- 8.1.2.3 ---\n\t\t\tXML Docu no in nuget package\n\t\t\tSupport for custom audio channel layout\n\t\t\tAudioFifo-Bugfix\n\t\t\tSome smaller changes\n\t\t\t--- 8.1.2.2 ---\n\t\t\tAdded namespace FFmpeg.Logging for logging.\n\t\t\t--- 8.1.2.1 ---\n\t\t\tMediaSource now copies the streams timebase into the CodecContexts timebase.\n\t\t\tThe CodecContexts timebase is writen into the frame if the  frame's timebase's numerator is 0.\n\t\t\t=== 8.1.2 ===\n\t\t\tUpdate to ffmpeg 8.1.2 \"Hoarse\".\n\t\t\tFormatContext was split into DemuxerContext and MuxerContext.\n\t\t\tMediaSource no longer thread-safe. It doesn't make sense to make it thread-safe as most of the time it will only be called from one thread.\n\t\t\tUpdate dependencies.",
